                        ],
                        "form": "Зеле́нских"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ccc7b39a-b5e3-3fa0-b7ac-169e52061b0f",
                        "entry_id": "e77a4e3b-fe78-30c1-b610-4abf09a730f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "русская, украинская, белорусская, польская и еврейская фамилия"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d038d27-a9ca-45ae-8b6f-22e49d7ac8a7",
                                "sense_id": "ccc7b39a-b5e3-3fa0-b7ac-169e52061b0f",
                                "text": "Заместитель председателя комитета Госдумы по финансовому рынку, экс-руководитель ГУ ЦБ по Саратовской области Юрий Зеленский уверен, что дефолт по беззалоговому кредиту в размере 12,4 млрд руб. будет неприятным событием, но серьезного воздействия на банковскую систему страны не окажет."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca6bc02d-6e94-49ad-8c57-ef833b9e1f53",
                                "sense_id": "ccc7b39a-b5e3-3fa0-b7ac-169e52061b0f",
                                "text": "Старпомом к нему был назначен капитан 3-го ранга Юрий Александрович Зеленский, ставший впоследствии первым командиром АПЛ «Комсомолец»."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3b74091-6b51-4e45-9826-16338ce7d2cd",
                                "sense_id": "ccc7b39a-b5e3-3fa0-b7ac-169e52061b0f",
                                "text": "Президент Украины Владимир Зеленский фактически признал существование плана захвата 32 российских бойцов «ЧВК Вагнера» во время их перелёта из Минска в Стамбул в июле прошлого года."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1be72356-2883-49e3-afbf-669507e03e49",
                        "source_entry_id": "e77a4e3b-fe78-30c1-b610-4abf09a730f9",
                        "source_sense_id": "ccc7b39a-b5e3-3fa0-b7ac-169e52061b0f",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zelensky",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Zelensky",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9d50610-f606-3ca6-b833-a5ee4e367460",
                                        "entry_id": "8b1ce914-2db7-3b76-bf04-1f0041c5549d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of Zelenskyy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37d01760-f14a-4e7b-b3da-85db60c507e3",
                                                "sense_id": "f9d50610-f606-3ca6-b833-a5ee4e367460",
                                                "text": "Oleksander said he had told Zelensky that Kira was “tired but happy” and thanked him for the safe return of his granddaughter. “Nobody believed [it would be possible]. But thank God we managed,” he told CNN."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "daec328a-4c73-4579-9386-dea7601206c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "e77a4e3b-fe78-30c1-b610-4abf09a730f9",
                        "source_sense_id": "ccc7b39a-b5e3-3fa0-b7ac-169e52061b0f",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zelenskyy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Zelenskyy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05f4bc14-8509-3d4b-bce7-a1c91a63c171",
                                        "entry_id": "5b4ddb70-fbca-3ecb-9090-a23639dd92e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A surname from Ukrainian."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "719c8b7b-0af5-3f0c-9c15-45f598fe7451",
                                        "entry_id": "5b4ddb70-fbca-3ecb-9090-a23639dd92e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A surname from Ukrainian.",
                                            "Volodymyr Zelenskyy (born 1978), Ukrainian politician, the sixth and current president of Ukraine since 2019."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e762149-d6ce-400d-9ba7-616d781f6fb7",
                                                "sense_id": "719c8b7b-0af5-3f0c-9c15-45f598fe7451",
                                                "text": "“President Zelenskyy of Ukraine and I had a very good phone call earlier today. He congratulated me on a very successful Republican National Convention and becoming the Republican nominee for President of the United States,” Trump said in a post on Truth Social."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62116da8-c188-4fa1-9237-822a2b535dce",
                                                "sense_id": "719c8b7b-0af5-3f0c-9c15-45f598fe7451",
                                                "text": "“We agreed to work together, very closely, including visiting each other’s Nations. We have also agreed to have our respective teams start negotiations immediately, and we will begin by calling President Zelenskyy, of Ukraine, to inform him of the conversation, something which I will be doing right now,” Trump wrote."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
